:140,"position":{"x":8700,"y":4770},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":1860,"text":"General Timeline","textSize":64,"textBold":true,"textAlignment":"left"},{"id":"slvNDCJzaz-pbT4mYxdZB","fillColor":"#afbec5","height":20,"position":{"x":8681.2431640625,"y":5500.25},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":1778.2568359375002,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Inter","attachedFrame":"50DiT9uytkHQLmX_W8r00"},{"id":"62-whgLfCRx9Th9KQp8Kk","fillColor":"#afbec5","height":60,"position":{"x":10450,"y":5480},"type":"shape","kind":"triangle","width":80,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Inter","attachedFrame":"50DiT9uytkHQLmX_W8r00","rotation":90},{"id":"lT53Vmc7gfzU7U9dPmTUW","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4770},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PhGcasblOAg0hFYq76JlW","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"SDLFXjs6MhtOksX35yhhf","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":4940},"width":1680,"height":1060,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Timeline: How it works in 4 steps\n\n🎯 Purpose: Arrange events in time, e.g. project history, a reading unit in class or a roadmap.\n\n1. Define the axis (5 min)\nAction: Replace the example years with your time points (years, months, sprints).\n\n2. Collect events (10 min)\nAction: Everyone writes events on cards and places them at the right point.\nRule: Above the axis = plans or milestones, below = actual events (or define your own rule).\n\n3. Connect (10 min)\nAction: Discuss gaps, overlaps and causes. Add missing cards.\n\n4. Conclude (5 min)\nAction: Highlight the 2–3 most important moments and what follows from them.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nStructurer: Agree on the above/below rule before starting.\nStoryteller: Summarise the timeline as a short story at the end.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PhGcasblOAg0hFYq76JlW","textSize":30,"textColor":"#000000"}]}]}}